{
  "info": {
    "name": "Student Awards — COMP 3613 A2 API Tests",
    "description": "API + workflow tests for the Student Awards application (COMP 3613 Assignment 2).\n\n**Before you run — entry criteria:**\n1. Reset and seed the demo database: `python manage.py init`\n2. Start the app: `python manage.py run` (http://localhost:5000)\n3. Import this collection and keep **Automatically follow redirects** enabled (the Postman default).\n4. **Run the collection top to bottom** — later folders reuse the session cookie and the variables (`cause_id`, `reward_id`, `document_path`, `submission_id`) set by earlier requests.\n\nIf you run it from the repository root with Newman, use:\n`npx newman run postman/StudentAwards.postman_collection.json`\n\nFolders: Smoke → Authentication → API (student) → Workflow 1 Submit Hours → Workflow 3 Redeem Progress → Workflow 2 Verify Hours (admin).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test(\"Every response arrives in under 2 seconds\", function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    }
  ],
